	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Conception requête complexe]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=12906#p12906"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Le plus simple pour résoudre ça, c&#039;est une Window Function</p><p>SELECT id_commande,<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;username,<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;etat,<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;date_evt,lead(date_evt) over (partition by id_commande order by date_evt) - date_evt <br />from commande_historique ;<br /> id_commande | username |&#160; etat&#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; date_evt&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | ?column? <br />-------------+----------+---------+------------------------+----------<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;1 | Client&#160; &#160;| Créé&#160; &#160; | 2012-01-01 19:50:25+01 | 11:54:52<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;1 | Admin&#160; &#160; | Accepté | 2012-01-02 07:45:17+01 | 02:51:44<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;1 | Client&#160; &#160;| Modifié | 2012-01-02 10:37:01+01 | 03:51:12<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;1 | Admin&#160; &#160; | Accepté | 2012-01-02 14:28:13+01 | 17:33:39<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;1 | Admin&#160; &#160; | Validé&#160; | 2012-01-03 08:01:52+01 | </p><p>Disponible à partir de PostgreSQL 8.4: <a href="http://docs.postgresql.fr/9.1/tutorial-window.html" rel="nofollow">http://docs.postgresql.fr/9.1/tutorial-window.html</a></p>]]></content>
